            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "A simple shooter with weird controls; fight through levels filled with shape monsters to discover the Fake World's true origins. <br><br><strong>Built for VR</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fake World utilizes the HTC Vive's hardware to create a completely unique gaming experience</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fake World brings innovative new movement systems to the VR scene; you have never played anything like Fake World</li></ul><br><strong>Movement and Combat</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Move freely through levels in zero gravity by throwing your move sphere and absorbing its velocity</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After a few levels unlock and experience a transformative new teleportation mechanic</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight through hoards of enemies</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dodge and shoot down enemy bullets to survive</li></ul><br>Throw your ball to move in it's direction",
            "about_the_game": "A simple shooter with weird controls; fight through levels filled with shape monsters to discover the Fake World's true origins. <br><br><strong>Built for VR</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fake World utilizes the HTC Vive's hardware to create a completely unique gaming experience</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fake World brings innovative new movement systems to the VR scene; you have never played anything like Fake World</li></ul><br><strong>Movement and Combat</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Move freely through levels in zero gravity by throwing your move sphere and absorbing its velocity</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>After a few levels unlock and experience a transformative new teleportation mechanic</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight through hoards of enemies</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dodge and shoot down enemy bullets to survive</li></ul><br>Throw your ball to move in it's direction",
            "short_description": "Fake World® is an action-packed VR game in zero gravity. Fight through hordes of enemies, discover Fake World's unique movement systems, and uncover the truth about reality in this adrenaline pumping adventure.",
